    "pf-0a62a5c2": {
      "type": "pf-0a62a5c2",
      "settings": {
        "pf_e8408243_value": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <b><a href=\"https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/\" target=\"_blank\">User Guide</a></b> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com",
        "pf_d7a789ba_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(247, 255, 154);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 255, 154);\">★</span> <strong>ThePhotoStick® Omni 32GB:  $28.00</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$34.99</s><br><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 255, 154);\">★</span> <strong>ThePhotoStick® Omni 64GB:  $44.00</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$54.99</s><br><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 255, 154);\">★</span> <strong>ThePhotoStick® Omni 128GB:  $64.00</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$79.99</s><br><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 255, 154);\">★</span> <strong>ThePhotoStick® Om</strong><strong>ni 256GB:  $99.16</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$123.95</s><br><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 255, 154);\">★</span> <strong>ThePhotoStick® Omni 512GB:  $234.99</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;<s>$179.95</s>",
        "pf_2b3286c9_value": "Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices!<br><br>It's compatible with Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and later<br>- Android: 6.0 and later*<i><br></i><sup>*ThePhotoStick Omni is NOT compatible with Google Pixel smartphones.<br></sup><br>For more up to date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href=\"/pages/support-system-requirements\" target=\"_self\">System Requirements</a> page.&nbsp;",
        "pf_799022c1_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni 2.0 is a tiny device that can find and sort thousands of photos and videos on ANY device. It automatically finds and sorts your favorite files with complete accuracy, ensuring that no memory is ever missed. You can now safely store and share each and every precious moment with the newest member of ThePhotoStick® family.<br><br>Works on popular desktop computers, laptops, tablets, and mobile phones from Windows, Mac, Android, and iPhone.",
        "pf_654dfa15_value": "We are committed to delighting each customer of ThePhotoStick®. We are so confident you will love it, that we offer a no-risk 30-Day Money Back Guarantee, starting at the day of delivery.\n<br><br>Try out our full line of ThePhotoStick® products, with no risk! If you have any issues and are not completely satisfied with your purchase for whatever reason, simply contact returns@thephotostick.com or visit our Live Chat support at thephotostick.com.",
        "pf_fad266af_value": "Enjoy this time with the ones you love most, and let ThePhotoStick Omni 2.0 do the hard work for you.<br><br>You'll never have to waste hours of time trying to find, organize, and backup each of your photos and videos, again.\n\nThePhotoStick Omni 2.0 can find, sort and organize your most treasured files. No lost hours. No missed photos. No Cloud fees.",
        "pf_03eeb92c_value": "We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, we are happy to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund.",
        "pf_bcf1ffa8_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni is a small device that can find and sort thousands of photos and videos on ANY device. It automatically finds and sorts your favorite files with complete accuracy to ensure no memory is ever missed.&nbsp;<br><br>Works on popular desktop computers, laptops, tablets, and mobile phones from Windows, Mac, Android, and iPhone.",
        "pf_a5fdfab7_value": "I got all my pictures, screenshots and downloads off my phone, tablet and laptop. What a relief. I have had several phones die over the years and so much info was on them. I don't trust drop box or just saving photos on a device, google took ALL of mine and I have no idea where they are. This photo stick is worth every penny.",
        "pf_27d0d862_value": "Price with Checkout Code:<br><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 32GB: <b>$47.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$59.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 64GB: <b>$63.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$79.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 128GB: <b>$79.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$99.99</s> - 👑 Popular!<br>ThePhotoStick Omni 256GB: <b>$119.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$149.99</s>",
        "pf_ae87665d_value": "Price with Checkout Code:<br><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 32GB: <b>$47.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$59.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 64GB: <b>$63.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$79.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 128GB: <b>$79.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$99.99</s> - 👑 Popular!<br>ThePhotoStick Omni 256GB: <b>$119.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$149.99</s>",
        "pf_9e464401_value": "Love it!! I had 2,500 photos on my iPhone and doubles. The stick in less than 3 minutes downloaded and deleted doubles. Now my phone is freed up and 2,000 originals are on the stick😃. Great gift idea for Christmas 🎄\rThanks also for the support of staff in answering emails so quickly.",
        "pf_8b3e476c_value": "Never risk losing your memories to the Cloud or accidents, again, with the newest member of ThePhotoStick® family! <br><br>ThePhotoStick® Omni 2.0 automatically finds, sorts, and saves thousands of your most treasured photos and videos across any of your devices.",
        "pf_01f57c02_value": "This holiday weekend, protect your memories the easy way.<br><br>ThePhotoStick® Omni makes it effortless to protect those once-in-a-lifetime moments without the stress of sorting, organizing, or losing them. <b><i>Shop today and get 20% Off!</i></b>",
        "pf_feb72847_value": "Approximate* Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>128 GB - 51,200 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size.</em>",
        "pf_508105f4_value": "Of course! Visit our website, www.thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST",
        "pf_0364ede0_value": "This SO easy to work with. Simply pug it in, load the small app, and click. Sit back have a coffee or two. (If you are picture hoarder like me a short nap is good) I don't mean to imply it is slow I had a lot of pics.",
        "pf_d6a73f61_value": "Love it love it love it One of the best things I have ever bought to put pictures on I have almost 4000 pictures on in and still have Room to add more easy to work easy to use. Such a great thing to have.",
        "pf_c90feae9_value": "Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people plug ThePhotoStick® Omni in each night for a quick and easy backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.\r\r",
        "pf_488b6c89_value": "No frills, just the memory-saving magic trusted by thousands.<br><br>The original ThePhotoStick® Omni is still available for those who love our tried-and-true backup solution.",
